  "description": "I possessed a character in a female-oriented dating simulation game. As the Second Prince, he seduces the female protagonist to overcome his inferiority complex toward the First Prince, Edward. I don't want to be killed by Edward. I don't want to interfere with someone else's love life, and I don't want to be hated.\n\n *\"You like her. I have no feelings for her.\"\n\n\"Right. It's better not to like her. You'll never end up with her.\"*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
